Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.95,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamu Yamoo…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.13,0:00:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,assumption?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's got to be out of his gourd\Nto go through with this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.93,0:01:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're starting this match with only 400\Nlife points thanks to your friend Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking his place was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Noah, you overpowered Kai\Nby using deceit and betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you used your virtual technology\Nto turn him and Mokuba into stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think that makes you a superior\Nduelist, you're sadly mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe what you wish, but as soon as I\Nfinish refreshing my deck with new cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.25,0:01:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you and your friends will meet\Nthe same fate as Seto and Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's been involved in some pretty tough
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.07,0:01:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,duels against some major\Nwhack jobs in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.47,0:01:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but I gotta say, this duel\Ndefinitely takes the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only is Yugi almost out of life\Npoints, he has no monsters on the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And Noah just merged himself\Nwith his deck master, Shinado!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.45,0:01:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Noah can crush\NYugi with one attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.15,0:01:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be a robot monkey statue!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, we're all here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can save Mokuba and\NKaiba and get us out of this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now rip this freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.91,0:02:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Blah, blah, blah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.45,0:02:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can silence your cheerleaders\Nby turning them into statues!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.23,0:02:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, just to be fair, I'll let you\Ngo first. Very well! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.23,0:02:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This better be a monster card, or I've\Ngot nothing to protect my life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can control us like pawns?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm about to end your game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Gazelle, the King of Mythical Beasts, in\Ndefense mode to protect my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to get a monster on\Nthe field, Yugi. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so quick to start\Nthe celebration if I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,because it's my move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid you're not the only\Nduelist capable of drawing a monster card,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,so prepare to lose your gazelle, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappointed with your draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means my gazelle\Nisn't going anywhere, is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.69,0:03:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then you guessed wrong,\Nbecause I can still annihilate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the power of Shinato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.27,0:03:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.19,0:03:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,These six orbs combine\Nto form the Divine Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Shinato, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster was in defense mode, which means\NI shouldn't have lost any life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.75,0:03:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that Shinato's special\Nability has caught you off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, when my deck master destroys\Na monster that's in defense mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you lose half your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not the only\Nthing that happens, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It gets much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the life points you\Njust lost get added to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that guy needs any more\Nlife points. You still gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:04:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,beat the virtual stuffing out\Nof this kid you're a fool to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,think you could defeat me and\Nnow you and your friends are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.27,0:04:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,about to pay the price all\Nbecause you're defending the honor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,of someone who didn't even\Nlike you yugi kaiba and i have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.47,0:04:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,quite a bit in common we're\Nboth participants in an ancient
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,struggle that dates back 5\N000 years And Kaiba and I have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.15,0:04:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,something else in common Something\Nyou'd know nothing about,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And what might that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He duels with honor\Nand respect Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And you think that makes\Nyou both superior to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes us human Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.93,0:04:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't be human for long\NOnce I blow away what's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,left of your life points You'll\Nall be motionless objects
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly believe you can win this\Nwith only 200 life points left? Yes, I'll.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,take you down somehow noah you'll see\Nnow it's my move i'll place this monster
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:05:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,face down in defense mode and then i\Nshall end my turn noah even your defensive
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters aren't safe, so you set them up\Nand I'll just keep knocking them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.53,0:05:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to play a monster\Nwho resides in the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the spirit monster known\Nas Yatakurasu in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A spirit monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I'll get to that in a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but first I'll destroy your\Nface-down monster card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.89,0:05:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But your monster's weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Obnoxious Celtic Guardian's\Nspecial effect protects
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,it from all monsters with\N1,900 attack points or more,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and yours has over 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can still activate the magic\Ncard known as Spring of Rebirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This card grants me 500 life points\Nwhenever a monster returns to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that Yatagorasu is back in my\Nhand, my Spring of Rebirth activates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,raising my life points to over 8,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,8,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi's only got 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke the rules again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just call a\Ncard back to your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When Maximilian Pegasus was\Ndesigning the game of Duel Monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.61,0:06:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,his travels brought him\Nto the Mystical Orient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.97,0:06:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he learned of the legendary Spirit\NMonsters, beings with otherworldly powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.57,0:06:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So he based a series of\Ncards on these beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.61,0:06:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,giving them the ability to return to\Ntheir owner's hand after every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you accuse me of cheating, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.03,0:06:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of Kaiba's Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.05,0:06:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that Noah merged with his\NDeckmaster and moved onto the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:06:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,he's wide open for an attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can destroy him with Kaiba's Monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win this duel and\Nget us out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall place this\Nmonster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing would thrill me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon my Asura, who's\Nyet another spirit monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.71,0:07:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now say goodbye to your\Nobnoxious guardian, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Asura, attack with Daggers of Demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.03,0:07:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You mentioned earlier that your obnoxious\NCeltic Guardian is immune to damage
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,from monsters with 1900 attack points\Nor more. But unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My Asura only has 1700 attack\Npoints, so say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And now witness the power of my Asura's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.51,0:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Special ability. Multiple attack? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.81,0:07:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Noah's Asura card is gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,attack again The power\Nof multiple attack gives
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Asura the ability to attack every monster
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,on your side of the\Nfield on the same turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.41,0:08:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm afraid your face-down monster is\Nabout to go, leaving you defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Asura, wipe out Yugi's last\Nmonster with your daggers of demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, Yugi. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you've fallen right into my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,trap By attacking one of\NKaiba's favorite cards
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.61,0:08:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyberjar! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so And that means all monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,on the field are destroyed\NAnd since you move
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,your Deckmaster to the field Your Shinato\Nis destroyed as well And you lose the duel
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew Yugi would crush\Nthat little nutcase!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.79,0:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Banana Splits Order! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my Deck\NMaster's second ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Reversal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Noah? He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Yugi just won the duel! He did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Yugi didn't win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But how were you able to escape\Nthe destructive power of Cyberjar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining has more than one power,\Nand before it was destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that power was activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,See, whenever Shinado is targeted\Nby an opponent's monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.55,0:09:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,its ability of reversal is activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing my Deckmaster to\Nleave the playing field
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and returns to its original\Nposition on the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shenado cannot be summoned back to the\Nfield for the duration of the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.89,0:10:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you can't use it to\Nattack me for the rest of the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, thanks to the second effect of my\Ncyber jar, we must each draw five cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then every monster we pick\Nmust be summoned to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon two monsters, San-Gan and Gamma\Nthe Magnet Warrior, both in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you must summon every\Nmonster that you've drawn, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, then it's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll sacrifice Gamma the\NMagnet Warrior and Sangen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.47,0:10:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This activates Sangen's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to add any monster with 1,500\Nattack points or fewer into my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll take Big Shield Gardner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, thanks to my sacrifice, I'll\Nsummon this Dark Magician in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no monsters on\Nthe field to defend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, attack\Nhis life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.39,0:11:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He knocked off 2,500 life\Npoints, which leaves 5,600 left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, I've cleared out your monsters and\Ntaken a bite out of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, how dare you humiliate me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Humiliate you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you who humiliated\NKaiba and Mokuba just so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.93,0:11:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you can prove to your\Nfather that you're superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.35,0:11:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I deserve to be rewarded\Nfor my unsurpassable power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You must earn respect, Noah,\Nnot demand it. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps your father should\Nhave recognized your talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe you have been treated unfairly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No one deserves to be locked away in isolation\Nthe way that you were by your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,However, that's still no excuse for\Nthe way you've been treating us, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough out of you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.09,0:12:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my next world magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.39,0:12:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a close look at\Nthis magic carpet, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You may recognize someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It chooses one of your\Nmonsters and allows me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to summon one with the\Nsame number of stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.57,0:12:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So I choose this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.87,0:12:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamata Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a load of that thing, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.85,0:12:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even stronger than\NYugi's Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That dragon will devour it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, attack him now with\Neight-headed flame attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.73,0:13:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And 100 of your life\Npoints transfer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, spirit monster, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember what that means, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My Spring of Rebirth magic card\Nis automatically activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,adding an additional 500\Nlife points to my score.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.91,0:13:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,His life points keep\Nincreasing with every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.35,0:13:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If Noah keeps this up, I'll\Nnever get them down to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have 100 life points left now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of\Ntime before you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let this kid push you around, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.31,0:13:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you. Taya's right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all behind you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's counting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.99,0:13:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Yugi. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The safety of all my friends\Ndepends on my victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's get on with this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:13:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.59,0:14:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I shall activate the magic\Ncard, Swords of Revealing Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This wall of swords will prevent you\Nfrom attacking me for three turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just delaying his defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now you've got Noah\Nright where you want him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.99,0:14:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's got nothing on you. That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you just bought yourself\Nthree turns to figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,how to kick this twerp's virtual\Nbutt and get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard just about enough from Yugi's\Nlittle pep squad down there. Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Karibos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.51,0:14:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Karibo, attack Noah's\Nlife points right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pathetic little\Npuffball barely made a dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dueling tactics are beneath me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You can swat at me with\Nthat dust buddy all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid it's not going to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as your swords\Nof revealing light are gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll erase you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.85,0:15:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you seem to be a much better\Nduelist than Seto, by defeating you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be proving my power over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.09,0:15:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now on with the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one monster\Nface down in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yugi, it's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.01,0:15:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's only two turns left,\Nand then I'm allowed to attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.93,0:15:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she could help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.31,0:15:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd need Kaiba's Deckmaster to\Nsummon her without a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.15,0:15:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But his Kaiser Seahorse can\Nonly summon monsters of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.83,0:15:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And Dark Magician Girl\Nis a monster of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.51,0:15:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I'll have to do this instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Big Shield\NGardner in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.87,0:15:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll switch\NKaribo into defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go ahead and make your move, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.83,0:15:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,First I place this\Nmonster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.07,0:15:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And last but not least,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face down on the field\Nnow it's just one more turn and then it's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.93,0:16:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,lights out and i'll be\Nready what am i gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,do none of these cards\Ncan help me i'll place
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,this card face down and\Nend my turn well yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.93,0:16:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,i think it's clear how this will end on my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,next turn you're going\Nto lose this duel then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you and your friends\Nwill be turned to stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You can beat this guy\None, two, three, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.91,0:16:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends still think you can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they're more\Nclueless than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.67,0:16:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down here and say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.63,0:16:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're just jealous\Nbecause Yugi over here actually
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,has friends and you're just\Na spoiled little brat who's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,angry at the world because\Nsomeone stuck you in a computer
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.31,0:16:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,with no one to hang out\Nwith except your sorry self.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I think your friend made his point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So now it's only fair that I\Nget a chance to make my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:17:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've listened to your loudmouth\Nfriends insult me for too long now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid made a sniff out of dude, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so much fun, I think\NI'll transform you all into stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,one by one with each turn\NI take. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.09,0:17:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rearrange your\Nface, you little brass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, or you'll be next to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're all so confident\Nthat Yugi's going to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided to put\Nyour fate in his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So with every turn that\NYugi fails to defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,another of you will be turned to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be frozen in time with\Na look of despair on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.15,0:17:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Yugi failed to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.85,0:17:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the end, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.55,0:17:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be left in the\Nmiddle of a circle of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,motionless statues that\Nwere once your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,what's so funny you're\Nnothing but a child six
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,years may have passed but\Ni'm afraid you haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,matured at all you're\Na weak boy i am strong
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,well not strong enough\Njust look come on you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,can still beat this lame-o that's right so
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you even Think about\Ngiving up this fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They still have faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be so\Nsurprised if you had been
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,given the chance to\Nexperience true friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.57,0:18:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just bitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I need to know about\Nfriendship is how to destroy it! My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.35,0:18:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I activate my face-down trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.31,0:18:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Pyro Clock of Destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My swords of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.25,0:18:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but my Pyro Clock of Destiny\NTrap Card causes time to move faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So they expire one turn sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.93,0:18:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I summon the dreaded Otohime\Nto the field in Attack Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:19:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my new\NMonster Special Ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can switch any of your monsters from\NDefense to Attack Mode, or vice Virus, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And I choose your Karibo, so your\NPuff Ball switches to Attack Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's attacked, I'll lose the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll sacrifice Otohime\Nand my face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.71,0:19:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,to bring back an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.27,0:19:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his Yamada Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.31,0:19:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My dragon will wipe out your\NKaribo and your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.83,0:19:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamada Dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.59,0:19:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is mine!
